# Git tren may nay dat core.autocrlf=true, nen moi lan checkout git doi LF -> CRLF
# cho tat ca file van ban. Voi shell script thi do la loi: bash doc dau \r nhu mot
# phan cua lenh va bao nhung thu vo nghia kieu `$'\r': command not found`, hoac
# `/usr/bin/env: 'bash\r': No such file or directory` — deu tro sai huong hoan toan,
# vi file van ton tai va noi dung van dung.
#
# Dong duoi ep *.sh luon la LF trong thu muc lam viec, bat ke autocrlf.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Ly do tuong tu: cac file nay chay tren Linux (VPS) hoac duoc doc boi cong cu
# khong chap nhan CRLF.
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
